<title>PORTUGAL: Yield falls on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield falls on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Treasury's auction of 20 billion escudos of three-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: 23/3/99</p>
<p>    COUPON: 8.50	 AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.7995</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER:68.18 HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.8000</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 250.63 the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
